R6 establishes a bounded self-revision result: a finite generic mutation
library, shadow evaluation, rollback, and hidden promotion selected a protected
one-shot binding mechanism. It does not establish arbitrary source-code
invention, recursive improvement without an external mutation library, human
superiority, or general intelligence.

