# R32 prerequisite: exact R31 replay

**Status: PASS_EXACT_EQUIVALENCE.**

Seed 9700 was rerun using the persisted R31 sequential evidence source and dependencies. The regenerated hard-correct mean (0.9931481481481481), mean physical probes (1.32), and genuine-ambiguity abstention (0.575) are exactly identical to the persisted R31 seed-9700 row; maximum absolute delta is 0.0.

This establishes a valid implementation/evaluator anchor for the next R32 matched ablations. The earlier V3 synthetic A control is superseded as an evaluator and remains retained only as a rejected diagnostic.

