 # V14A keeps V13 cognition/representation/economics fixed and changes only developmental support.
 # Reusable consequence trials during development include generic stationary, stochastic,
 # step-change, reversal, and unstable-then-stable histories. Their hidden generator mode is
 # never a learner feature; delayed grounded outcomes alone determine action utility.
 # The existing recursive INSPECT credit remains unchanged.
