46b9468d68f44485aab1ed136f5d6cb1edf4cf68 blob 6353
# R32 Handoff â€” Epistemic World-State Uncertainty + Native Self-Chunking

## Superseding native-terminal update â€” 2026-08-28

E50 is a further valid native negative. It compared the E49 matched joint batch
control with two explicit endogenous contention features: provenance-adjusted
co-viability and temporal support/counterevidence contention. Both varied
structurally (55,080 and 8,852 interior records), and all integrity gates passed
across 9,180 complete validation cells. But treatment changed no-unique outcomes
from 12,488 UNKNOWN / 7,912 wrong to 12,428 UNKNOWN / 7,972 wrong: 60 fewer
abstentions and 60 more wrong commitments. The outcome is
`NO_TESTED_GROUNDED_PROVENANCE_TEMPORAL_CONTENTION_RESCUE`; R27 remains
canonical. Evidence:
`R32_E50_PROVENANCE_TEMPORAL_CONTENTION_NEGATIVE_3ECA4702_NO_TESTED_CONTENTION_RESCUE/EVIDENCE.json`.

The next bounded question is whether the action-value target geometry, not a
further representation coordinate, is the causal bottleneck. Do not assign a
positive UNKNOWN value unless it is derived from delayed utility and remains
independent of evaluator ambiguity.

E49 is now also a valid native negative. Against a fresh E48-joint batch control,
it added only one grounded nonlinear term: `trunc(slot3 Ã— slot5 / 1000)` in a
previously masked terminal coordinate. The source SHA is `62326d58â€¦`, the two
official binaries are identical at `09bf24bcâ€¦`, and integrity is `1`. The term
varied on 36,594 canonical records, but it produced 600 fewer no-unique UNKNOWN
choices and 600 more wrong commitments. The outcome is
`NO_TESTED_GROUNDED_QUADRATIC_RESCUE`; R27 remains canonical. Evidence:
`R32_E49_GROUNDED_QUADRATIC_COMMIT_VALUE_NEGATIVE_62326D58_NO_TESTED_QUADRATIC_RESCUE_EVIDENCE.json`.

E49's former next-step note is superseded by E50. The next bounded question is
whether delayed investigation/termination action value is missing from the
static terminal-target geometry, with the same native/fresh-grid discipline.

The native-toolchain blocker is resolved for the current E45â€“E50 harnesses. The
official persisted Linux x86-64 `znc` compiled E48 twice to identical binary
`5efdab6533f66fabe9ef90c9edd6092e8c90cceeef58c8fe44e1fd4dc680a884`.
R27 nevertheless remains canonical: all four terminal-controller experiments are
valid native negatives, not qualification results.

E45 established a real no-unique safety failure under the repaired evaluator.
E46 showed a large order-conditioned abstention/resolution tradeoff but no tested
order rescue. E47 showed that two varying grounded co-presence statistics did not
rescue the blocked online linear head. E48 then crossed exact blocked one-pass
online fitting with a specified, forward/reverse-identical complete-dataset batch
fit and baseline/joint E47 representation. E48 integrity passed, confirmation was
sealed, but neither batch arm satisfied every no-unique cell:

| Arm | No-unique UNKNOWN | Wrong | Safe cells | Known success |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| online baseline | 0 | 20,400 | 0/1,020 | 54,182 |
| online joint | 0 | 20,400 | 0/1,020 | 54,182 |
| batch baseline | 12,219 | 8,181 | 346/1,020 | 50,338 |
| batch joint | 12,260 | 8,140 | 318/1,020 | 48,575 |

E48 is therefore `NO_TESTED_BATCH_SAFETY_RESCUE`, not an evaluator or deployment
failure. It bounds the current linear commit-value geometry under these two fit
rules. UNKNOWN still has grounded target zero and all UNKNOWN-head parameters are
exactly zero. Do not turn it into an ambiguity label or confidence threshold.

Authoritative evidence:
`R32_E48_ONLINE_BATCH_REPRESENTATION_NEGATIVE_24E8098F_NO_TESTED_BATCH_SAFETY_RESCUE_EVIDENCE.json`.

Next bounded experiment: preregister the smallest grounded nonlinear
commit-value-head or richer endogenous causal-representation discriminator against
E48â€™s frozen controls. Preserve evaluator, seeds, records, and every-cell gates;
do not reopen R31 or promote R32.

R31 should not be restarted. Its central architecture decision is supported:

`raw episodic route + endogenous reversible chunks + active grounded evidence`

## Priority 0 â€” Native Zag authority
Obtain a real `znc` from `Sylorlabs/zag`, persist it durably, compile the exact R31 source, repair source incompatibilities, run deterministic double-build/checked parity, and reproduce the quantitative gates natively. No Python result promotes.

## Priority 1 â€” Epistemic ambiguity representation
The best R31 policy handles misleading evidence well but recognizes only ~57% of deliberately no-unique-answer cases. Do not add another fixed probe threshold.

Build a persistent non-graph hypothesis population that represents:
- multiple possible referents/world states;
- evidence provenance and dependence;
- probability/evidence mass that remains unresolved;
- temporal stability/instability of the latent source;
- cross-modal consistency;
- expected information gain of another observation;
- explicit `UNKNOWN` when remaining hypotheses cannot be discriminated economically.

Train only from delayed outcomes/regret; do not expose an ambiguity label.

## Priority 2 â€” Native dual-route chunking
Port/reproduce the causal ablation natively:
- raw-only;
- chunk-only;
- dual raw+chunk.

The native system should retain chunk compression/indexing while proving that exact raw episodic retrieval preserves hard discriminative capability.

## Priority 3 â€” Chunk resource policy
Use TNN-controlled memory to decide:
- which chunks deserve exact raw exemplars;
- which can be compressed;
- when to retrieve raw evidence;
- when a chunk should split, merge, specialize, archive, or be rebuilt.

Use future regret and resource envelopes, not aesthetic compression targets.

## Priority 4 â€” Natural continuous media
Move self-chunking from synthetic microstate streams toward natural synchronized raw audio/video/action streams. Evaluator annotations may score human-aligned boundaries after the fact but never enter TNN cognition.

No pretrained ASR, vision model, tokenizer, transformer, or LLM inside TNN.

## Priority 5 â€” Long native life
Run >=250k events if curves justify it, with recurring world regimes, entity replacements, natural coarticulation, siblings with different chunk histories, teacher withdrawal, save/reload, resource pressure, and self-revision.

Persist every major checkpoint immediately to `/TNN/Research`.

