# R28 â†’ Next Stage Handoff

Continue from the verified **R27 accepted state** plus the R28 shadow source/evidence. Do not relabel R28 as canonical until native execution exists.

Priority order:
1. Materialize the pinned Zag compiler locally and compile/run `src/tnn_r28_aeif.zag` natively; establish deterministic double compile/run and save/reload.
2. Reproduce the promoted/shadow reference mechanisms natively with matched multi-seed differentials.
3. Keep AEIF/associative episodic identity authoritative; graph remains optional derived relation indexing.
4. Improve confidence calibration for adversarial/high-confidence sensory corruption without sacrificing rapid switches.
5. Keep memory default = privileged heuristic, but explicitly train TNN override/replacement and seek a learned policy that eventually surpasses the hardcoded default on the same utility. LRU stays eviction-only.
6. Attack connected speech as context-conditioned acoustic sequence learning, not as isolated motifs plus guessed hard cuts. Preserve all failed CTC/DTW/EM/transition branches.
7. Expand contextual affordance toward >95% noisy while retaining unseen-context transfer.
8. Push independent sibling interactive transfer above the current hard-noise boundary without shared weights or evaluator IDs.
9. Improve substrate Foundry from six-profile meta-search to many procedurally distinct landscapes and require clear learned-over-random replication.
10. Use strong diagnostic Master early; diversify/withdraw when competence evidence supports it.
11. Rerun the continuous-life integrated qualification, then immediately harder post-99/post-100 challenges.
12. Preserve R25/R26/R27 regressions and every negative branch.

