The workflow also recorded the source-file SHA-256 values before compilation, including `01a=d176e733â€¦`, `01b=d7873c9aâ€¦`, `01c=d8c708a4â€¦`, `02a=340281d1â€¦`, `02b=71562055â€¦`, `02c=34c767b6â€¦`, `02d=e1c05da1â€¦`, and main injection `7ae7f792â€¦`.

## Integrity and frozen-model gates

- E50 seed preflight: `1`
