E49's former next-step note is superseded by E50. The next bounded question is
whether delayed investigation/termination action value is missing from the
static terminal-target geometry, with the same native/fresh-grid discipline.

The native-toolchain blocker is resolved for the current E45â€“E50 harnesses. The
