e3d325066db46a62b5780c83592f3a85b661d7e8 blob 3602
# E51AJ validation record

Scientific source `9ea141b050599854783258d82cfa3ee02efb1fad`; run `33952427608`;
artifact `9965575939`; original local archive
`.scratch/e51aj/actions-33952427608-5H2tNi/`. Date: 2026-09-05 Pacific.

## Completed evidence checks

The terminal run/job are successful, attempt 1, with the expected source tree.
The unique artifact has 8,098,800 bytes, 95 files and ZIP SHA-256
`a64d9060e695a73a31a2d5c134a5000da0c7e79d40903a72958c0ba022f3c735`.
Archive CRC, path safety, duplicates, symlinks and all extracted bytes passed.
All 65 frozen inputs match Git/current files; official compiler and immutable
Baseline V1 match their pinned identities. Both Linux builds are byte-identical.

The frozen scientific verifier reproduces the archived report exactly and checks
1,101,600 native episode rows and 67,860 coefficient rows. An independent
bit-mask implementation recomputes all 510 pooled panels, 2,040 cohort panels,
fixed-anchor retention, paired final contrasts and both outcome rules.
It agrees with the frozen parser. No cognition or scientific generator was
executed locally during this analysis.

All 21 analysis/archive/table-rendering tests pass, including 100 synthetic
retention matrices checked against direct arithmetic, a full-shape artificial
ledger, duplicate rejection and Markdown rendering. All 11 frozen verifier
tests pass. Syntax parsing passes for all eight analysis Python files.
Native synthetic preflight passed in the completed official Linux workflow;
the pre-execution local Mac target correction is recorded in
[PREEXECUTION_REVIEW.md](PREEXECUTION_REVIEW.md). Synthetic fixtures are not
experimental observations. Actionlint was not run.

Native execution used 1,212.8876720490002 seconds, exited zero and did not time
out. Peak resident memory was 487,296 KiB; the 5,400-second, 2-GiB address-space
and 1-GiB individual-file caps were not extended. Whole job: 22m27s.

## Interpretation and review scope

The preregistered retention rule fails in replicas 0 and 1 and passes in replica
2; the overall result is `MIXED_OR_UNREPLICATED_RETENTION_DIRECTION`.
The separate aggregate no-final-behavioral-tradeoff flag fails in every replica.
The main task inspected all checkpoint curves, baselines, cohort retention,
coefficient changes, fixed secondary contrasts and initial-decision differences.

The completed pre-execution ChatGPT Web review concerns design only. Its prior
agent was unavailable on attempted reuse in this continuation. A new explicit
ChatGPT Web Pro reviewer completed the bounded interpretation audit and confirmed
the failed conditions, recovery/retention distinctions and pointwise decision
tradeoffs. [POSTEXECUTION_REVIEW.md](POSTEXECUTION_REVIEW.md) records its identity,
scope, checked observations and unexecuted counterfactual suggestion. This does
not replace archive, compiler or raw-arithmetic verification.

## Delivery closure

The delivery validator passed against the original archive after result,
authority and handoff changes. Its scope includes exact evidence/table
regeneration, source/result SHA-256 identities, the result's primary table,
current operational pointers, row counts, local links and six protected AI/AH
result/evidence/status files. It is rerun on the final delivered state; the
machine-readable result is stored as DELIVERY_CHECK.json. Git closure and
duplicate-run checks are separate operational checks; neither proves cognitive
success.

[Reproduction instructions](README.md), [complete tables](TABLES.md),
[result](../R32_E51AJ_RESULT.md), and [evidence](../R32_E51AJ_EVIDENCE.json).

